                        "entry_id": "3323a5cf-43c6-3fd0-82a8-9ae9890c72a5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The bubble-shaped chamber of a pot still that connects the swan neck to the pot and allows distillate to expand, condense, and fall back into the pot."
                        ],
